<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA INDUSTRY OUTPUT 18.3 PCT DOWN YR/YR IN MAY HOLD.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA INDUSTRY OUTPUT 18.3 PCT DOWN YR/YR IN MAY HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output in</p>
<p>May dropped 18.3 percent below the level of May last year, the</p>
<p>State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>MOLDOVAN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION  May'97 April'97 May'96</p>
<p> Monthly pct change		   -2.8  -13.3     +5.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year pct change	   -18.3  -13.3    +19.8</p>
<p>(EDS BOTH MTH/MTH AND YR/YR FIGURES IN APRIL ARE -13.3)</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
